rule HonourHumanReviewPreference
	statement: Honour the customer's stated preferences. When Preference field humanReviewFor lists new_credit, insurance_purchase, mandate_change or household_access, those decisions always need a human specialist.
	lineageTag: 6446d7ec-fa2e-5bc3-a311-eaa6bb79de71

	ruleReferencedEntity Preference
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty Field

		ruleReferencedProperty PreferenceValue

	ruleReferencedRelationship 'Preference Stated By Customer'
